    "<p style='background-attachment:initial; background-clip:initial; background-image:initial; background-origin:initial; background-position:initial; background-repeat:initial; background-size:initial; margin-bottom:0in; margin-top:0px;'><span style='color:rgb(16,14,14); font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-size:12pt;'><strong>Accuracy:</strong>&nbsp;The City of Ottawa provides this information in good faith but provides no warranty, nor accepts any liability arising from any incorrect, incomplete or misleading information or its improper use. N/A represents a non-active camera.&nbsp;</span><span style='color:#100e0e; font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-size:16px;'>ASE cameras previously listed as installed in 2021, sites E009-E013, have been updated to 2022 in the Camera_Install_Year field as of October 22nd, 2024.</span></p><p style='background-attachment:initial; background-clip:initial; background-image:initial; background-origin:initial; background-position:initial; background-repeat:initial; background-size:initial; margin-bottom:0in; margin-top:0px;'><br />&nbsp;</p><p style='background-attachment:initial; background-clip:initial; background-image:initial; background-origin:initial; background-position:initial; background-repeat:initial; background-size:initial; margin-bottom:0in; margin-top:0px;'><span style='color:rgb(16,14,14); font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-size:12pt;'><strong>Update Frequency:</strong>&nbsp;</span><span style='color:#100e0e; font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-size:16px;'>Monthly</span></p><p style='background-attachment:initial; background-clip:initial; background-image:initial; background-origin:initial; background-position:initial; background-repeat:initial; background-size:initial; font-family:&quot;Avenir Next W01&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next W00&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next&quot;, Avenir, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size:16px; margin-bottom:0in; margin-top:0px;'><span style='color:rgb(16,14,14); font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-size:12pt;'>&nbsp;</span></p><p style='background-attachment:initial; background-clip:initial; background-image:initial; background-origin:initial; background-position:initial; background-repeat:initial; background-size:initial; font-family:&quot;Avenir Next W01&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next W00&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next&quot;, Avenir, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size:16px; margin-bottom:0in; margin-top:0px;'><span style='color:rgb(16,14,14); font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-size:12pt;'><strong>Attributes:</strong></span></p><ul><li><span style='font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-size:12pt;'>Location: Street location of the Automated Speed Enforcement Camera</span></li><li><span style='font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-size:12pt;'>Year: Camera Install year</span></li><li><span style='font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-size:12pt;'>Latitude / Longitude</span></li><li><span style='font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-size:12pt;'>X and Y coordinate format is projected in MTM Zone 9, NAD83 (CSRS)</span></li><li><span style='font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-size:12pt;'>Months: The number of violations in each month</span></li><li><span style='font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-size:12pt;'>Total Violations: The total number of violations for the year</span></li><li><span style='font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-size:12pt;'>Highest Monthly Total: The highest violation number in a month</span></li></ul><div>&nbsp;</div><div><strong>Data Steward: </strong>Connor Fowke</div><div><strong>Data Steward Email:&nbsp;</strong><a href='mailto:Connor.Fowke@ottawa.ca' rel='nofollow ugc'>Connor.Fowke@ottawa.ca</a></div><div><strong>Department or Agency: </strong>Traffic Services</div><div><strong>Branch/Unit:</strong> ASE</div>"
